AltoRewardsDistributor::setLockContract
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new lock contract is zero address
    │   ├── it should set lock contract to zero
    │   └── it should emit SetLockContract event
    ├── when new lock contract is not zero address
    │   ├── it should update lock contract
    │   └── it should emit SetLockContract event
    ├── when updating lock contract multiple times
    │   ├── it should update lock contract for each call
    │   └── it should emit SetLockContract event for each call
    ├── when setting back to zero after non-zero
    │   ├── it should set lock contract to zero
    │   └── it should emit SetLockContract event
    └── when setting same lock contract again
        ├── it should keep the same lock contract
        └── it should emit SetLockContract event
